      "summary": ": Terrain temporarily closed today: Mt Cardona, Summit Monday 27/07 We are open today with another crisp bluebird day ahead! It has been cold and dry all night making for some excellent snow conditions out there for the grooming and snowmaking teams again. We have some more cold crisp corduroy for your Monday! We are forecast to have low temps again with a Westerly breeze so please wrap up warm for the chairlift. Cloud may increase later this afternoon with the freezing level rising. The Road is Chainfree but chains must be carried. Passes: Everyone with a season's pass will need a picture on their profile/pass this year. If you're unsure if you have one, pop into any Guest Services location and they will be able to sort you out.",
